{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>They die</b> — bet. 'Like the death of all men they die, and the earth like a garment is consumed, and its inhabitants like so — they die.' Meaning: after 'the earth is consumed and its inhabitants,' they die — they are swallowed beneath it." "<b>ופקודת</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, ופקודת משמרת, and ופקודת אלעזר בן אהרן. Because they sought to enter the פקודת of Elazar — they sought the priesthood. Therefore: ופקודת כל האדם וגו'." "<b>ופקודת כל האדם יפקד</b> — Moses said: if HaShem does not do to these as He does to all men, for He visits the iniquity of fathers upon children and upon the third and upon the fourth generation — but rather punishes them immediately."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:23.839154104Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}